  "also": "SEPARATE and EXACT: the bands family. `family_cells.bands` (base) and `interaction_by_family.bands.cells` must equal the registered integers TO THE CELL, as they do on all 32 seq5 layer chunks at both contexts. Any nonzero deviation is a finding in its own right and must be reported even if rho passes -- it means the layout identities in `band_cells` do not hold at a shape whose `nh` and `d` are not powers of two, which is the one thing the closed form's own docstring flags.",
