    "basis": "a single 8B chunk runs -1.18% to +8.59% around the 32-layer mean at C=4096, ENTIRELY from the per-layer master exp table. Every other family is identical to the cell across all 32 layers, and the whole chunk is the exact identity `cells.fresh == bands(S, C) + 1,006,949,376 + 5 * 2^log_table`, verified on all 32 chunks at BOTH contexts (`log_table` 22..25, `interaction_by_family.table` 56.0-173.4 Mcells). The run MUST report `params.log_table` and `interaction_by_family.table.cells` for the layer it proved.",
